Summary: Activate a focused window without a simulated WM_MOUSEACTIVATE (backport from Wine 10.6)
Category: input
Kind: fix
Origin: winehq
  Commit: b568eaac4aeb
  Bugs: 48121
  Authors: Rémi Bernon
  URL: https://gitlab.winehq.org/wine/wine/-/commit/b568eaac4aeb
  Note: also CrossOver's hack 18896 (window.c part), which Sikarugir 10.0_8 carries
Origin: crossover
  Version: 25.1.1
  CW-Hacks: 18896
  Note: CX's hack also changed cocoa_window.m (WINDOW_GOT_FOCUS for focus
    changes Wine makes itself); that part was dropped on 2026-11-26 (patch
    review: no program known, WineHQ never took it, and WineHQ master removes
    that event).
Upstream: yes, b568eaac4aeb (in Wine 10.6)
Why: When a Mac window gains focus, winemac sent the window a simulated
 WM_MOUSEACTIVATE (a click on its menu) to ask whether it wants to be
 activated. Unity games lose input after alt-tab because of it (WineHQ bug
 48121). It now activates the window without asking, as WineHQ does from
 10.6. Wine 11.x has this upstream, so there is only a 10.0 copy.
Programs: Unity games that lose input after alt-tab, such as MTG Arena and
 Subnautica: Below Zero (WineHQ bug 48121)
Evidence: Sikarugir 10.0_8: its macdrv_window_got_focus makes no
 NtUserGetAncestor or NtUserMessageCall call (125 vs 142 instructions,
 function comparison 2026-11-15).
Status: 2026-11-26: reduced to the window.c hunk; not yet in a build.

diff --git a/dlls/winemac.drv/window.c b/dlls/winemac.drv/window.c
index 115820e..7223389 100644
--- a/dlls/winemac.drv/window.c
+++ b/dlls/winemac.drv/window.c
@@ -1899,12 +1899,7 @@ void macdrv_window_got_focus(HWND hwnd, const macdrv_event *event)
 
     if (can_window_become_foreground(hwnd) && !(style & WS_MINIMIZE))
     {
-        /* simulate a mouse click on the menu to find out
-         * whether the window wants to be activated */
-        LRESULT ma = send_message(hwnd, WM_MOUSEACTIVATE,
-                                  (WPARAM)NtUserGetAncestor(hwnd, GA_ROOT),
-                                  MAKELONG(HTMENU, WM_LBUTTONDOWN));
-        if (ma != MA_NOACTIVATEANDEAT && ma != MA_NOACTIVATE)
+        /* CrossOver Hack #18896: don't send WM_MOUSEACTIVATE, it breaks Unity games */
         {
             TRACE("setting foreground window to %p\n", hwnd);
             NtUserSetForegroundWindow(hwnd);
